WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Sleep pressure builds with time awake.
Body-clock timing also helps organise

2
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:12.000
sleepiness and wakefulness. The processes
interact.

3
00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:18.000
People differ in their timing and
opportunities to sleep. Choose a practical

4
00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:24.000
routine around your actual rest period.

5
00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Hours are part of the picture. How you
function during the day also matters. A

6
00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:36.000
selected duration does not measure sleep
quality.

7
00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Persistent difficulties deserve
assessment. General sleep tips are not the

8
00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:48.000
same as structured treatment for insomnia.
Do not drive when sleepy.
